    <p>
      <b>Description</b>
    </p>
    <p>Frequency-swept sinusoidal signal (chirp) from f0 to f1 over a duration.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Ports</b>
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>Input(s)</b>
    </p>
    <p>This block declares no input ports.</p>
